        <p>NOTICE.—All parties having claims against the late Dr. JOSEPH ADAMS, of 93, BewacY- street, Warrington, are Requested to lodge the same with the Subscribers within 14 days from this date, and all parties indebted to the Deceased are Re- quested to make payment forthwith to, the Sub- scribers.</p>
        <p>ROWLEY. ORR ez CO.. Agents for Deceased's Executors. (a 3 West Regent-street, Glasgow, 21st September, 1916.</p>
