        <p>CORPORAL J. MANNION. Comrade's• Tragic News Contradicted By Victim. Contrary to news contained in a letter from a comrade at the Front to the effect that Corporal John Mannion, of the South Lance. Regiment, has been killed in action, along with a staunch friend, Private Patrick Cornelia, of the same regiment, Mrs. Mannion, a widow, who resides at 5, Litherlandrs-yard, off Old-</p>
