        <p>CASUALTIES. Continued from page 5. DIED OF WOUNDS. RIFLEMAN J. ALLEN. Nineteen-Year-Old Hero Dies Of ,Wounds. Rifleman Joseph Allen, King's Royal Rifles, and who formerly resided with Mr. and Mrs. Warburton, 11, Dixon-street, has died of wounds. Rifleman Allen, who was only 19 years of age, had been in the Army eighteen months, and was an old boy of Wycliffe School.</p>
